    <abstract id="aspace_f4e4199a2055333152a15d97c68cc74d">This collection contains materials used to write <emph render="italic">Polytechnic University: Changing the World - the first 150 years.</emph> These were returned by Write Stuff Enterprises, the publisher of the book, in February 2026. Changing the World was published in 2005 and chronicles the history of the university.</abstract>
