  </did>
  <accessrestrict id="aspace_46baa9533b70f1017c3525f657ecd3e7">
    <head>Conditions Governing Access</head>
<p>Materials are open for use without restrictions.</p>  </accessrestrict>
  <acqinfo id="aspace_9adcb400a316ee11e42157dc1db8cc6d">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>Write Stuff Enterprises used materials from the Poly Archives for their book <emph render="italic">Polytechnic University: The First 150 Years.</emph> In 2026, Write Stuff Enterprises came across remaining archival materials that belonged to the Poly Archives. They returned them in February 2026. The accession number associated with this transfer is 2026-002.</p>  </acqinfo>
  <arrangement id="aspace_f145ddc3d8d11bb9d17e206b2692cd96">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>This collection is arranged into two series: Series I. Monographs; Series II. Documents. Folders are arranged by subject.</p>  </arrangement>
  <bioghist id="aspace_f95cd37319914c4c7d526a214b802964">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p><emph render="italic">Polytechnic University: Changing the World - the first 150 years</emph> was written to celebrate Brooklyn Poly's 150th year anniversary. It recounts the history of the university from its birth to 2005. Many of the collections within the Poly Archives were used to create the book.</p>  </bioghist>
  <prefercite id="aspace_ae9c072bd33c283099b071b6c07e8653">
    <head>Preferred Citation</head>
<p>Identification of item, date; Changing the World Collection; RG 068; box number; folder number or item identifier; Poly Archives at Bern Dibner Library of Science and Technology, New York University.</p>  </prefercite>
  <processinfo id="aspace_a2952cf4d0205aebdb075adcd311631c">
    <head>Processing Information</head>
<p>Materials were placed in new acid-free folders and boxes. The collection was arranged into two series based off of format. Folders within Series II were arranged by subject. Documents within Series II were taken out of plastic sleeves and rehoused into acid-free folders.</p>  </processinfo>
  <scopecontent id="aspace_0cb36e1669df509013a522ed605594b6">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This collection contains monographs, photos, images, and text documents.</p>  </scopecontent>
